---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/retail.css';
---
<Base
  title="Contact &mdash; Airborne Dent Repair"
  description="Call 682-226-0543 or visit Airborne Dent Repair at 489 Reed Ln, Unit 2, Gunter, TX 75058. Free estimates, Monday through Saturday, 9:00 AM to 7:00 PM."
  nav="Contact" css="retail">
<main>

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="display h-xl rv rv-d1">Call Us.<br>Or Come By.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv rv-d2">Estimates are free. Call, email, or bring the vehicle to the shop on Reed Lane in Gunter &mdash; Monday through Saturday, 9:00 AM to 7:00 PM.</p>
    <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">Email the shop <span>&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero-facts rv rv-d3">
      <li>Free estimates</li><li>Veteran owned</li><li>Gunter, TX &middot; serving DFW</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-figure slot">
    <span class="slot-tag hero-slot-tag">Photo pending &mdash; [SHOP-EXTERIOR]</span>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Where To Send It</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:20ch">Two Inboxes.</h2>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">Retail work &mdash; hail, dents and door dings, windshields, tint &mdash; goes to the shop inbox. Insurance claims and wholesale or fleet accounts go to the claims desk, which is watched separately.</p>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">If you are not sure which one you need, call. It is faster than guessing, and the phone is the quickest way to reach us on a working day.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rv rv-d1">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Direct Lines</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Retail &amp; estimates</dt><dd><a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Claims &amp; wholesale</dt><dd><a href="mailto:Claimsairbornedentrepair@gmail.com">Claimsairbornedentrepair@gmail.com</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Fax</dt><dd>833-907-5267</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">The Shop</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">489 Reed Lane, Unit 2.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap intro" style="margin-top:2rem">
    <div class="rv">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Address</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Street</dt><dd>489 Reed Ln, Unit 2</dd></div>
        <div><dt>City</dt><dd>Gunter, TX 75058</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Service area</dt><dd>Gunter &middot; DFW &amp; North Texas</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Catastrophe response</dt><dd>Deployed nationally to severe hail events</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=489+Reed+Ln+Unit+2+Gunter+TX+75058"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get directions <span>&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rv rv-d1">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Hours</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Monday &ndash; Friday</dt><dd>9:00 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Saturday</dt><dd>9:00 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Sunday</dt><dd>Closed</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Windshields</dt><dd>Mobile or in-shop</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Before You Call</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">Four Things That Speed It Up.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="steps">
  <div class="step rv rv-d0">
    <p class="n">01</p>
    <h3>Year, make and model</h3>
    <p>Panel sizes and paint depth differ by vehicle, so this is the first thing we ask.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d1">
    <p class="n">02</p>
    <h3>Photos of the damage</h3>
    <p>Shot at an angle, with light running across the panel rather than straight at it. Dents read better that way.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d2">
    <p class="n">03</p>
    <h3>Where the vehicle is</h3>
    <p>In Gunter, elsewhere in North Texas, or somewhere a storm has just been through.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d3">
    <p class="n">04</p>
    <h3>Whether insurance is involved</h3>
    <p>If you have a claim number already, have it handy. If you do not, that is fine too.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">What We Do</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">Four Services.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="others">
  <a class="other rv" href="/hail-damage-repair">
    <h3>Hail Damage Repair</h3>
    <p>Whole-storm damage or a single dented panel, repaired without touching the factory paint.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="other rv" href="/paintless-dent-repair">
    <h3>Paintless Dent &amp; Door Ding Repair</h3>
    <p>Door dings, creases and transport damage &mdash; no filler, no paint, lifetime warranty.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="other rv" href="/windshield-replacement">
    <h3>Windshield &amp; Glass</h3>
    <p>Replacement at the shop or mobile at your home or workplace, whichever suits you.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="other rv" href="/window-tint">
    <h3>XPEL Window Tint</h3>
    <p>XPEL film exclusively, carrying the manufacturer&rsquo;s warranty.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
</div>

<a class="cross" href="/wholesale">
  <p class="eyebrow">Dealer, body shop or fleet?</p>
  <h2 class="display h-sm">Wholesale &amp; Fleet Accounts</h2>
  <p>Pickup and delivery, up to 25 vehicles a week, and the same lifetime warranty on every
    paintless repair we perform.</p>
  <span class="go">See wholesale <span>&rarr;</span></span>
</a>

<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap final-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Gunter, Texas &middot; Serving DFW &amp; North Texas</p>
      <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:16ch">Get A Free Estimate.</h2>
      <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">Email the shop <span>&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-block rv rv-d1">
      <strong>Airborne Dent Repair</strong>
      <span>489 Reed Ln, Unit 2</span>
      <span style="margin-bottom:.6rem">Gunter, TX 75058</span>
      <a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a>
      <span>Fax 833-907-5267</span>
      <span style="margin-top:.6rem">Mon&ndash;Sat 9:00 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM &middot; Closed Sunday</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
</Base>
